I attempted to force a chest with an orcish dagger, and failed.  I hit ctrl-A,
and tried again.  After several ctrl-A's, I finally succeeded in forcing the
chest.  Imagine my surprise, when Nethack started attempted to force the chest
over and over again... This loop was finally broken by the fortituous arrival
of a large kobold, who did proceed to beat upon my hapless barbarian, after
which I stopped trying to force the lock.  However, I think I tried to force
that already open lock some 30 times before said kobold arrived.

This happened with nethack 3.0p9, IBM PC version, official binaries.  This bug
was also sent in to the bug address (whatever it was, I don't have it in front
of me right now).  Whether or not it gets through is anyone's guess, since
half of everything I send from here seems to vanish into the void, but we can
hope.

